                'title' => 'Match-3 game engine: Xây dựng từ đầu với Phaser 3',
                'slug' => 'match-3-game-engine-xay-dung-tu-dau-phaser-3',
                'category' => 'game-dev-tutorial',
                'tags' => 'match-3,candy-crush,phaser,tutorial,puzzle,engine',
                'meta_description' => 'Hướng dẫn xây dựng Match-3 engine hoàn chỉnh (Candy Crush style) bằng Phaser 3: swap, match detection, cascade, scoring.',
                'short_description' => 'Xây dựng Match-3 game engine từ zero: swap tiles, match detection, cascade fill, combo scoring.',
                'description' => '<h2>Match-3 — Thể loại tỷ đô</h2><p>Candy Crush Saga kiếm $1B+/năm. Match-3 là thể loại game casual phổ biến nhất. Hãy xây dựng engine của riêng bạn.</p><p>🎮 <a href="/choi-game/keo-ngot-xep-3">Chơi thử Match-3 game trên LamGame</a></p><h2>Core Mechanics</h2><ol><li><strong>Grid</strong>: Board NxM cells, mỗi cell chứa 1 tile (color/type)</li><li><strong>Swap</strong>: Player đổi chỗ 2 tiles adjacent</li><li><strong>Match</strong>: 3+ tiles cùng color liên tiếp (ngang/dọc) → xóa</li><li><strong>Cascade</strong>: Tiles rơi xuống lấp chỗ trống, tiles mới spawn từ trên</li><li><strong>Chain</strong>: Cascade tạo match mới → combo!</li></ol><h2>Data Structure</h2><pre><code>interface Tile {\n  type: number;  // 0-5 (6 colors)\n  row: number;\n  col: number;\n  sprite: Phaser.GameObjects.Sprite;\n}\n\n// Board = 2D array\nconst board: (Tile | null)[][] = [];</code></pre><h2>Match Detection Algorithm</h2><pre><code>function findMatches(board: Tile[][]): Tile[][] {\n  const matches: Tile[][] = [];\n  const rows = board.length, cols = board[0].length;\n  \n  // Check horizontal\n  for (let r = 0; r < rows; r++) {\n    for (let c = 0; c < cols - 2; c++) {\n      const t = board[r][c]?.type;\n      if (t != null && board[r][c+1]?.type === t && board[r][c+2]?.type === t) {\n        let match = [board[r][c]!];\n        let i = c + 1;\n        while (i < cols && board[r][i]?.type === t) match.push(board[r][i++]!);\n        if (match.length >= 3) matches.push(match);\n        c = i - 1;\n      }\n    }\n  }\n  // Similar for vertical...\n  return matches;\n}</code></pre><h2>Cascade (Fill empty cells)</h2><pre><code>function cascade(board: Tile[][]): void {\n  for (let c = 0; c < cols; c++) {\n    let emptyRow = rows - 1;\n    for (let r = rows - 1; r >= 0; r--) {\n      if (board[r][c] !== null) {\n        // Move tile down to fill\n        if (r !== emptyRow) {\n          board[emptyRow][c] = board[r][c];\n          board[r][c] = null;\n        }\n        emptyRow--;\n      }\n    }\n    // Fill top with new tiles\n    for (let r = emptyRow; r >= 0; r--) {\n      board[r][c] = createRandomTile(r, c);\n    }\n  }\n}</code></pre><h2>Game Loop</h2><pre><code>async function processMove(r1, c1, r2, c2) {\n  swap(board[r1][c1], board[r2][c2]);  // Swap\n  let matches = findMatches(board);\n  if (matches.length === 0) {\n    swap(board[r1][c1], board[r2][c2]);  // Swap back\n    return;\n  }\n  while (matches.length > 0) {\n    await animateRemove(matches);  // Xóa + animation\n    score += calculateScore(matches);\n    cascade(board);                // Fill\n    await animateFall();           // Drop animation\n    matches = findMatches(board);  // Check chain\n  }\n}</code></pre><h2>Download source hoàn chỉnh</h2><p>📦 <a href="/source-game">Kẹo Ngọt Xếp 3 — Full source Phaser 3</a></p><p>🤖 <a href="/ai-tools#asset">Tạo candy sprites bằng AI</a></p>',
