                'title' => 'Hướng dẫn tích hợp Leaderboard realtime cho game HTML5',
                'slug' => 'huong-dan-tich-hop-leaderboard-realtime-game-html5',
                'category' => 'game-dev-tutorial',
                'tags' => 'leaderboard,redis,api,html5,realtime,tutorial',
                'meta_description' => 'Xây dựng leaderboard realtime cho game HTML5 với Redis sorted sets. Backend API + frontend integration. Code hoàn chỉnh.',
                'short_description' => 'Hướng dẫn tích hợp leaderboard realtime vào game HTML5: Redis sorted sets + REST API + frontend display.',
                'description' => '<h2>Leaderboard — Tăng retention 3x</h2><p>Players quay lại chơi nhiều hơn khi có bảng xếp hạng. Trong bài này, chúng ta xây dựng leaderboard realtime dùng <strong>Redis Sorted Sets</strong>.</p><h2>Tại sao Redis Sorted Sets?</h2><ul><li>O(log N) cho insert và rank lookup</li><li>Built-in sorting by score</li><li>Support range queries (top 10, top 100)</li><li>Atomic operations — no race conditions</li></ul><h2>Backend API (Laravel + Redis)</h2><pre><code>// POST /api/games/{gameKey}/leaderboard\npublic function store(string $gameKey, Request $request) {\n    $player = $request->input(\"player\");\n    $score = (int) $request->input(\"score\");\n    $key = \"game:leaderboard:\" . $gameKey;\n\n    // Only update if higher score\n    $current = Redis::zscore($key, $player);\n    if ($current === null || $score > (int)$current) {\n        Redis::zadd($key, $score, $player);\n    }\n\n    $rank = Redis::zrevrank($key, $player);\n    return response()->json([\"rank\" => $rank + 1, \"score\" => $score]);\n}\n\n// GET /api/games/{gameKey}/leaderboard\npublic function index(string $gameKey) {\n    $key = \"game:leaderboard:\" . $gameKey;\n    $scores = Redis::zrevrange($key, 0, 19, \"WITHSCORES\");\n    // Format and return top 20\n}</code></pre><h2>Frontend Integration (1 dòng code!)</h2><p>Tất cả 49 games trên LamGame đã tích hợp sẵn qua shared wrapper:</p><pre><code>// Gọi khi game over\nLamGame.submitScore(score);\n\n// Hoặc manual fetch\nfetch(\"/api/games/2048-ghep-so/leaderboard\")\n  .then(r => r.json())\n  .then(data => showLeaderboard(data));</code></pre><h2>Hiển thị Leaderboard trong game</h2><pre><code>async function showLeaderboard() {\n  const res = await fetch(`/api/games/${gameKey}/leaderboard`);\n  const { data } = await res.json();\n  \n  data.forEach((entry, i) => {\n    this.add.text(x, y + i*30, \n      `${entry.rank}. ${entry.player} — ${entry.score}`,\n      { fontSize: \"16px\", color: i < 3 ? \"#FFD700\" : \"#FFF\" }\n    );\n  });\n}</code></pre><h2>Live trên LamGame</h2><p>API đang chạy production cho tất cả 49 games:</p><ul><li>GET <code>/api/games/2048-ghep-so/leaderboard</code></li><li>GET <code>/api/games/ran-san-moi/leaderboard</code></li><li>POST score tự động khi game over</li></ul><p>🎮 <a href="/choi-game">Chơi game và xem ranking</a></p><p>📦 <a href="/source-game">Source code leaderboard</a></p>',
